208
00:10:49.504 --> 00:10:51.304
<v Wes Hart>So why are you doing this?

209
00:10:51.741 --> 00:10:54.190
<v Jonathon>Because this show isn't for
men who have it together.

210
00:10:54.510 --> 00:10:58.400
<v Jonathon>It's for the man I was at twenty-nine,
sitting in that parking lot, watching the

211
00:10:58.410 --> 00:11:00.570
<v Jonathon>clock, deciding whether to go in.

212
00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:03.950
<v Jonathon>If that's you, I want you to
