214
00:11:07.190 --> 00:11:09.730
<v Jonathon>I'm proof this works for
a guy who started late.

215
00:11:09.926 --> 00:11:11.152
<v Wes Hart>And what do you bring?

216
00:11:11.579 --> 00:11:13.740
<v Jonathon>Questions. I'm going to push back on him.

217
00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:17.640
<v Jonathon>If he says something that sounds great at
