219
00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:21.388
<v Wes Hart>He will.

220
00:11:21.824 --> 00:11:24.344
<v Jonathon>I'm the guy in the back.
That's my job here.

221
00:11:24.590 --> 00:11:25.650
<v Wes Hart>That's a good job.

222
00:11:27.045 --> 00:11:30.740
<v Wes Hart>So the first chapter of the book I wrote,
and we'll tell you about the book later,

223
00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:34.970
<v Wes Hart>is called "A Quiet Tuesday."
And the idea is simple.

224
00:11:35.510 --> 00:11:41.730
<v Wes Hart>Most men are measured by their highlight
days. The wedding. The promotion. The trip.

225
00:11:41.730 --> 00:11:45.910
<v Wes Hart>The game where you were the
guy. And those days matter.

226
00:11:46.170 --> 00:11:50.570
<v Wes Hart>But that's not where a man gets
made. A man gets made on Tuesday.

227
00:11:50.950 --> 00:11:52.982
<v Wes Hart>The day nobody posts.

228
00:11:53.337 --> 00:11:55.321
<v Jonathon>Which is why we launched on a Tuesday.

229
00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:59.410
<v Wes Hart>Which is why we launched on a
Tuesday. That wasn't an accident.

230
00:11:59.830 --> 00:12:01.242
<v Jonathon>I thought that was an accident.

231
00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:03.110
<v Wes Hart>It was a happy accident.

232
00:12:03.630 --> 00:12:09.310
<v Wes Hart>And if this episode has one plain
point, it's this. Stop waiting.

233
00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:11.680
<v Wes Hart>That's the mark we're on today.

234
00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:17.770
<v Wes Hart>A lot of us are waiting to become a man we
