236
00:12:23.584 --> 00:12:24.430
<v Jonathon>Okay, so.

237
00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:29.114
<v Jonathon>Can I just tell the 1604 thing properly?
Because I gave the trailer version.

238
00:12:29.584 --> 00:12:30.370
<v Wes Hart>Tell it.

239
00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:34.890
<v Jonathon>Ruby was four, Theo was one, and
Dani had just gone back to nights.

240
00:12:35.210 --> 00:12:39.060
<v Jonathon>So three nights a week, I've got both of
