241
00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:41.850
<v Jonathon>And six o'clock at our house is chaos.

242
00:12:42.450 --> 00:12:46.670
<v Jonathon>Dinner, two baths, one of them screaming,
the whole fight about pajamas.

243
00:12:46.890 --> 00:12:49.220
<v Jonathon>And I'm coming off a day
of being good at the room.

244
00:12:49.230 --> 00:12:52.780
<v Jonathon>I'm on the phone with customers,
I'm closing, everybody likes me.

245
00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:57.265
<v Jonathon>And I'd drive home and I'd feel it in
