247
00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:05.910
<v Jonathon>Got on 1604 at six-fifteen,
which nobody does on purpose.

248
00:13:05.990 --> 00:13:07.780
<v Jonathon>Added twenty minutes of brake lights.

249
00:13:07.790 --> 00:13:11.860
<v Jonathon>And when I walked in, the sitter had
