251
00:13:16.550 --> 00:13:17.970
<v Jonathon>I got the highlight.

252
00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:19.730
<v Wes Hart>And skipped the Tuesday.

253
00:13:20.092 --> 00:13:22.550
<v Jonathon>I skipped the Tuesday. For two years.

254
00:13:22.770 --> 00:13:25.610
<v Jonathon>And here's the part I didn't
do the math on until later.

255
00:13:25.770 --> 00:13:27.730
<v Jonathon>We paid that sitter by the hour.

256
00:13:27.810 --> 00:13:32.130
<v Jonathon>So I was paying somebody by the hour
so I could sit in traffic on purpose.

257
00:13:32.390 --> 00:13:37.710
<v Jonathon>I told myself I needed the decompression.
And Dani's a nurse. She deals in facts.

258
00:13:37.950 --> 00:13:40.930
<v Jonathon>She just asked me since when I liked 1604.

259
00:13:41.110 --> 00:13:42.250
<v Wes Hart>What did you say?

260
00:13:42.733 --> 00:13:48.620
<v Jonathon>I said, "It's not that bad." And she said,
