262
00:13:52.624 --> 00:13:54.541
<v Wes Hart>I got an okay like that once.

263
00:13:54.779 --> 00:13:56.169
<v Jonathon>You got the okay?

264
00:13:56.310 --> 00:13:58.530
<v Wes Hart>Here's where I have to tell on myself.

265
00:13:58.530 --> 00:14:04.890
<v Wes Hart>In the fog years, I did all the big
