267
00:14:09.970 --> 00:14:12.930
<v Wes Hart>The pictures from those
trips are great pictures.

268
00:14:13.430 --> 00:14:18.160
<v Wes Hart>And then on a normal Tuesday, I'd come home
and eat supper in the recliner with the

269
00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:19.050
<v Wes Hart>news on.

270
00:14:19.449 --> 00:14:20.529
<v Jonathon>In the recliner.

271
00:14:20.815 --> 00:14:21.890
<v Wes Hart>In the recliner.

272
00:14:22.010 --> 00:14:24.930
<v Wes Hart>And the family's at the
table, fifteen feet away.

273
00:14:24.950 --> 00:14:28.300
<v Wes Hart>And for a while my wife would
