318
00:16:54.930 --> 00:16:59.710
<v Wes Hart>is dishonest with very little will
also be dishonest with much."

319
00:17:00.162 --> 00:17:06.560
<v Wes Hart>Tuesday is the very little. It's six-fifteen.
