325
00:17:30.971 --> 00:17:33.148
<v Wes Hart>He means it. He checks.

326
00:17:33.523 --> 00:17:36.030
<v Jonathon>I check every hour. When the watch beeps.

327
00:17:37.518 --> 00:17:39.810
<v Jonathon>Okay, so here's my
problem with all of this.

328
00:17:40.150 --> 00:17:41.167
<v Wes Hart>Here it comes.

329
00:17:41.614 --> 00:17:43.690
<v Jonathon>Some Tuesdays I'm just tired.

330
00:17:44.150 --> 00:17:48.060
<v Jonathon>Dani's on nights, I've had the kids
since five, Theo's been sticky since

331
00:17:48.070 --> 00:17:48.850
<v Jonathon>five-oh-two.

332
00:17:49.470 --> 00:17:52.590
<v Jonathon>Is it a sin to sit in the car
