334
00:17:57.098 --> 00:18:01.580
<v Wes Hart>No. Ten minutes in the car
isn't a sin. Rest isn't hiding.

335
00:18:02.051 --> 00:18:06.311
<v Jonathon>Okay, then what's the difference?
Because 1604 was me resting.

336
00:18:06.783 --> 00:18:07.450
<v Wes Hart>Was it?

337
00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:09.007
<v Jonathon>No.

338
00:18:09.292 --> 00:18:12.490
<v Wes Hart>Here's the test I use. When
