357
00:19:07.710 --> 00:19:10.970
<v Wes Hart>My kids remember the
coast. But here's my push.

358
00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:14.660
<v Wes Hart>Your daughter remembers the fishing trip
because you were there for her on a hundred

