00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:15.860
<v Wes Hart>Tuesdays around it.

360
00:19:15.870 --> 00:19:19.980
<v Wes Hart>If you'd been gone on all the Tuesdays,
the fishing trip would be a nice picture of

361
00:19:19.990 --> 00:19:21.950
<v Wes Hart>a guy she doesn't know very well.

362
00:19:22.674 --> 00:19:23.810
<v Jonathon>That's not fair.

363
00:19:24.146 --> 00:19:24.910
<v Wes Hart>Why not?

364
00:19:25.030 --> 00:19:27.294
<v Jonathon>Because it's true and
