366
00:19:31.550 --> 00:19:34.890
<v Jonathon>Episode one. I think the
big days are part of it.

367
00:19:35.094 --> 00:19:37.708
<v Wes Hart>They're part of it.
They're built on Tuesday.

368
00:19:37.990 --> 00:19:39.260
<v Jonathon>We'll come back to this.

369
00:19:39.550 --> 00:19:40.830
<v Wes Hart>We'll come back to it.

370
00:19:41.027 --> 00:19:42.810
<v Jonathon>Okay. Third thing.

371
00:19:42.970 --> 00:19:47.280
<v Jonathon>And this is for the guy who's listening
