00:21:11.030 --> 00:21:11.870
<v Jonathon>need me.

397
00:21:12.218 --> 00:21:13.690
<v Wes Hart>And then you drive home.

398
00:21:13.950 --> 00:21:17.670
<v Jonathon>And then I drive home, and nobody
